{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":17,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"06cab23a-1943-43e7-b1f7-9c7da926ca49","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351553242,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"管培生","OrgId":2685588,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"门店轮岗阶段（0-12 个月）\n完成茶饮制作、收银、物料管理等一线基础工作，保障门店日常运营；\n学习门店运营、客户服务与团队协作，按晋升路径从茶艺师进阶至储备店长；\n协助店长处理门店排班、数据统计等事务，积累门店管理基础经验。","Require":"一、通用能力要求\n具备扎实的学习能力，能快速掌握茶饮制作、门店运营等岗位技能，可举一反三适配岗位需求；\n拥有强烈的责任担当意识，工作认真负责，能主动承担岗位工作职责；\n具备良好的抗压能力，能适应茶饮行业一线工作节奏，面对工作压力与挑战耐挫力强；\n拥有清晰的逻辑思考与表达能力，沟通表达有条理，可高效对接工作与客户需求。\n二、核心素质要求\n✅ 乐于沟通交流，逻辑思路清晰，具备优秀的服务意识；\n✅ 学习能力突出，能主动学习、自我驱动，愿意从门店一线岗位扎实做起。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-04-01T11:18:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"85a78686-fc8f-482e-b67c-1853f28d4dd8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351550313,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"总部招商管理岗","OrgId":2685667,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责：\n1、负责对接并监督各代理分公司的招商活动，确保其按照总部要求开展工作。\n2、定期分析各分公司招商数据，提出改进措施和策略调整建议。\n3、组织并实施针对代理分公司招商团队的培训计划，提升其招商技能与品质把控能力。\n4、协助制定加盟商准入标准和门店选址评估体系，并跟踪落实到各个分公司。\n5、对各分公司的一线招商员工提供远程或现场指导，解答疑难问题，推动招商项目的顺利进行。","Require":"任职要求：\n1、大专及以上学历，市场营销、工商管理等相关专业优先，有餐饮行业招商加盟选址经验；\n2、能力素质要求：沟通能力强，能适应长期出差。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-24T09:04:48","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"42b931cf-4d0d-4aa4-9860-29eac5d32d22","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351548029,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"课程视频","OrgId":2685610,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"3","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"训练视频拍摄、剪辑及课程flash制作","Require":"技能要求；课程剪辑与MG动画制作，会一点AI视频生成","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-17T19:52:40","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"6e503c00-b5a7-4477-b7a8-bf17258fb08c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351544848,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"外卖数据中台岗","OrgId":2685613,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.数据监控与诊断：负责外卖全链路（用户、交易、履约、营收）核心指标的日常监控，搭建预警机制，定期输出业务分析报告，识别业务风险与增长机会。\n2.业务策略支持：结合区域特性，通过数据分析支撑流量分配、商户补贴、用户拉新留存等策略制定，对订单转化率、复购率、到手率等核心指标负责。\n3.项目落地与复盘：承接总部运营策略落地，跟踪成本优化、绩效提升、服务升级等核心项目进度，定期复盘项目效果，沉淀可复制的业务解决方案。\n4.跨部门协同：作为业务与技术、总部与代理公司的沟通桥梁，同步业务需求并推动数据能力落地，收集一线反馈反哺数据体系优化。","Require":"学历背景：运营类岗位大专及以上学历，统计学、数学、计算机、软件工程等相关专业优先。\n工作经验：运营类岗位需1-3年外卖/本地生活/即时配送相关经验\n熟练使用Excel（函数、透视表、看板）、SQL、Tableau","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-11T08:59:45","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"dd879dd0-cc48-4352-ba2b-e1c1dcbecc13","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351540740,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"门店设计师","OrgId":2685672,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、负责全国标准店设计方案及施工图出具，协助加盟商下单营建物料；\n二、益禾堂标准店SI设计规范制定、发布并持续优化；\n三、培训、指导、检核设计人员业务运用合规性，并定期做复盘总结；\n四、负责划分区域标准店出图质量及时效达标；\n五、巡店并定期与市场进行工作访谈，制定并完成专项工作计划；\n六、协助设计道具研发及招集采工作；","Require":"1.学历/专业要求：大学专科及以上学历，环境艺术设计/室内设计/展陈设计/平面设计等相关专业等相关专业；\n2.工作经历要求：2年及以上连锁品牌设计工作经验；\n4.能力素质要求：\n①熟悉连锁门店设计管理流程、标准及规范，具备良好的职业素养及工作习惯，对设计专业有较强的敏锐力；\n②责任心强，工作主动，有敬业精神，有较好的沟通和协调能力，有较强的适应能力和学习能力；\n③了解施工工艺、材质性能、造价结构等基本专业知识及CAD等软件运用；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-04T22:23:03","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b383cc56-2497-4b08-aa67-7adad8a98a1f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351536704,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"训练标准组经理","OrgId":2685610,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"一、战略规划与体系建设（30%）\n1.1 培训战略规划\n根据公司年度发展目标，制定训练标准组年度/季度战略规划\n设计分层培训体系架构，匹配不同岗位成长路径（新员工→在岗员工→管理岗）\n制定单店成功模式标准化复制策略，支撑全国门店扩张需求\n1.2 标准化体系搭建\n建立《门店运营标准化手册》体系，涵盖服务、产品、安全三大模块\n开发标准化课程库（SOP+视频+图文），确保全国8000+门店执行一致性\n设计岗位技能认证体系（初级/中级/高级茶饮师），与晋升通道挂钩\n1.3 培训资源整合\n搭建内部讲师梯队，选拔优秀店长/督导担任\"金种子讲师\"\n整合总部、外部机构资源，建立标准化培训资源库\n制定讲师激励机制（课时费+晋升优先），降低区域培训成本\n二、标准开发与迭代（25%）\n2.1 课程体系开发\n提炼单店运营核心SOP：产品制作、客户服务、食品安全等模块\n开发标准化课件及实操工具包，包括《新员工7天速成手册》\n设计季节性产品专项培训方案，保障新品上市执行标准化\n2.2 标准持续优化\n每月收集门店痛点数据（客诉率、损耗率、QC通过率）\n每季度修订《运营标准手册》，更新操作规范和技术参数\n建立危机响应预案升级机制（如食品安全突发事件处理）\n2.3 数字化工具应用\n部署\"益禾学堂\"APP，支持员工碎片化学习\n开发在线测试系统，追踪知识留存率（目标≥90%）\n利用ERP系统监控门店数据异常，触发培训干预\n三、培训实施与督导（20%）\n3.1 培训执行管理\n主导线下集训、带教帮扶、线上学习等多元化培训项目\n制定年度培训计划，确保每月覆盖≥20%重点门店\n监控培训落地效果，通过考核+门店实操反馈评估能力提升\n3.2 门店督导巡查\n执行标准化巡查清单（卫生、设备、服务流程等30+指标）\n建立48小时问题整改闭环机制，现场演示标准流程\n通过神秘顾客暗访（每月10%门店）量化评估服务质量\n3.3 带店支持与赋能\n新店开业前驻店指导，手把手教授标准化操作流程\n老店技能升级专项培训，针对高频错误点优化培训重点\n搭建常态化沟通机制，实时响应加盟商运营问题\n四、效果评估与改进（15%）\n4.1 数据化效能追踪\n建立培训档案系统，记录参训率、考核通过率等核心指标\n分析培训投入产出比（ROI），量化每万元培训投入的业绩提升\n定期输出《培训效能报告》，驱动总部业务决策优化\n4.2 员工表现评估\n设计三维度考核体系：理论笔试（80分合格）+实操模拟（85分合格）+服务暗访（80分合格）\n实施季度技能等级认证，考核结果与绩效奖金直接挂钩\n建立员工行为观察报告机制，识别培训盲区\n4.3 持续改进机制\n设立\"培训意见箱\"，每周收集员工匿名反馈\n每月召开跨部门复盘会议，根据业务变化调整培训重点\n每季度末联合门店店长更新培训手册，确保内容贴合市场变化\n五、团队管理与协作（10%）\n5.1 培训团队建设\n搭建\"总部-区域-门店\"三级培训网络组织架构\n培养区域\"学习管理员\"，负责本地培训执行与效果追踪\n制定培训人员能力雷达图，配套定制化发展资源\n5.2 跨部门协同\n建立\"培训-运营-门店\"三角联动机制，确保培训内容贴合业务需求\n联合运营部门提报技能缺口，门店骨干参与课程开发\n协同研发部门优化设备操作培训，保障新品技术落地标准化\n5.3 文化渗透与激励\n强化\"终身学习\"企业文化，减少员工培训抵触情绪\n实施\"标杆门店\"奖励机制（前10%门店获团队奖金）\n建立\"师徒制\"传承体系，优秀讲师优先晋升区域培训主管","Require":"1 基本要求\n学历：本科及以上学历（连锁经营管理、工商管理、人力资源专业优先）\n经验：3年以上连锁餐饮培训管理经验，熟悉门店运营全流程\n年龄：28-40岁之间\n2 专业能力\n课程开发能力：精通培训课程设计、教材编写、视频制作\n数据分析能力：熟练使用Excel、ERP系统，能通过数据优化培训策略\n标准化管理能力：熟悉SOP制定、执行监督、效果评估全流程\n数字化工具应用：了解在线学习平台、培训管理系统操作\n3 软技能要求\n沟通协调能力：能高效推动跨部门协作，处理加盟商关系\n团队管理能力：具备3年以上团队管理经验，能培养讲师梯队\n执行落地能力：强责任心，确保工作任务100%落实\n4 优先条件\n有茶饮行业头部品牌培训管理经验\n具备TTT（培训师培训）认证\n熟悉食品安全法规及餐饮行业最新规范\n有成功搭建培训体系并实现规模化复制案例","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-27T22:52:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"cd545ec9-1627-413b-940e-b0ea47427d89","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351528332,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"团购运营岗","OrgId":2685685,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 平台经营策略制定与执行\n· 分析各本地生活平台（如美团、抖音、快手等）的流量规则、用户画像及竞争环境，制定针对性的运营策略；\n· 负责平台活动的策划与落地，包括但不限于团购套餐设计、促销活动、节日营销等，确保活动效果与销售目标达成；\n· 监控平台数据（如曝光量、点击率、转化率、客单价等），定期输出经营分析报告，及时调整策略以提升运营效率。\n2. 用户运营与增长\n· 搭建并维护平台用户运营体系，通过会员权益、积分体系、精准推送等方式提升用户粘性与复购率；\n· 管理平台用户评价与反馈，制定优化方案，提升店铺评分与用户口碑；\n· 探索用户裂变与拉新策略，如拼团、分销、KOL合作等，实现低成本用户增长。\n3. 跨部门协作与资源整合\n· 与研发、品牌、营运、门店等部门紧密合作，确保平台活动与品牌整体营销节奏协同；\n· 协调平台资源（如流量位、补贴政策等），争取优势资源支持，提升品牌曝光与转化；\n· 协助门店端落实平台运营动作，提供培训与指导，确保执行效果。\n4. 数据驱动与优化迭代\n· 建立本地生活渠道的数据监控体系，定期分析竞品动态与行业趋势，为策略调整提供依据；\n· 通过A/B测试等方式优化页面呈现、套餐设计、促销话术等，持续提升用户体验与转化效率；\n· 探索新技术或工具（如自动化运营系统、AI推荐等）在本地生活场景的应用可能性。\n5. 风险管控与合规运营\n· 确保各平台运营符合平台规则与法律法规，避免违规操作导致的处罚或下架风险；\n· 监控舆情与用户投诉，及时协同相关部门处理危机事件，维护品牌形象","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，3年以上本地生活平台（美团、抖音等）运营经验，有茶饮或连锁餐饮行业经验者优先；\n2、 熟悉平台运营规则与流量逻辑，具备出色的数据分析能力与策略思维；\n3、具备较强的项目管理与跨部门协作能力，能高效推动策略落地；\n4、对用户运营有深度理解，擅长通过运营手段提升用户生命周期价值；\n5、结果导向，抗压能力强，能适应快节奏工作环境。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-23T17:00:49","JobVideoJd